<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Yes</font>

42
00:02:06,850 --> 00:02:12,860
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">or</font>

43
00:02:06,850 --> 00:02:12,860
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">No!</font>

44
00:02:06,850 --> 00:02:12,860
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Tsunade's</font>

45
00:02:06,850 --> 00:02:12,860
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Answer</font>

46
00:02:18,240 --> 00:02:19,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not good...</font>

47
00:02:21,070 --> 00:02:26,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it! Damn it!
This time for sure... no matter what!</font>

48
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:42,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're the only one who can treat
Orochimaru-sama's arms.</font>

49
00:02:45,140 --> 00:02:46,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't we make a deal?</font>

50
00:02:49,940 --> 00:02:55,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll resurrect the little brother
and man, both of whom you loved...</font>

51
00:02:55,900 --> 00:02:59,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with the Forbidden Jutsu I've developed.</font>

52
00:03:00,320 --> 00:03:03,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you want to see those two,
Tsunade...?</font>

53
00:03:04,200 --> 00:03:07,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! You must not believe
in their sweet talk...</font>

54
00:03:08,410 --> 00:03:11,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Their wishes...
Moreover, Tsunade-sama, your wishes...</font>

55
00:03:11,540 --> 00:03:13,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And dreams...
Did you forget them?!</font>

56
00:03:14,170 --> 00:03:15,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll be straight with you.</font>

57
00:03:16,050 --> 00:03:22,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade, the village has demanded
that you become the Fifth Hokage.</font>

58
00:03:23,180 --> 00:03:24,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The successive line of Hokages</font>

59
00:03:24,970 --> 00:03:27,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">have protected the Leaf Village
and those living in it.</font>

60
00:03:27,850 --> 00:03:29,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They brought troubled times under control</font>

61
00:03:29,520 --> 00:03:32,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and helped the village to prosper.</font>

62
00:03:32,150 --> 00:03:34,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They risked their lives for
this dream, this ideal!</font>

63
00:03:37,530 --> 00:03:39,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't have to answer right now.</font>

64
00:03:41,570 --> 00:03:44,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, I want it in a week.</font>

65
00:03:45,870 --> 00:03:49,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Also, two human sacrifices are
needed for this Forbidden Jutsu,</font>

66
00:03:50,750 --> 00:03:53,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so do what you need to do
to prepare them.</font>

67
00:04:06,010 --> 00:04:07,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We are starting!</font>

68
00:04:11,770 --> 00:04:13,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">C'mon. Place your bets!</font>

69
00:04:16,690 --> 00:04:19,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Which will you bet on, ma'am?</font>

70
00:04:21,070 --> 00:04:22,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Which one? C'mon!</font>

71
00:04:24,740 --> 00:04:26,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Which one will she choose?</font>

72
00:04:27,490 --> 00:04:30,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If she agrees to our conditions,</font>

73
00:04:31,450 --> 00:04:33,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">your arms will be healed,</font>

74
00:04:33,460 --> 00:04:36,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the destruction of the Leaf Village
will continue immediately.</font>

75
00:04:37,210 --> 00:04:40,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama will also be able to
be reunited with the two whom she loves.</font>

76
00:04:42,510 --> 00:04:45,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But if she doesn't agree...</font>

77
00:04:46,050 --> 00:04:50,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll have to force her to heal my arms...</font>

78
00:04:52,350 --> 00:04:54,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Will it really be that easy?</font>

79
00:04:54,690 --> 00:04:56,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have you.</font>

80
00:05:00,440 --> 00:05:01,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no need to worry.</font>

81
00:05:02,570 --> 00:05:06,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm the one who knows her the best.</font>

82
00:05:07,570 --> 00:05:09,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And her greatest weakness!</font>

83
00:05:11,200 --> 00:05:16,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She'll definitely accept the conditions...
Definitely!</font>

84
00:05:26,510 --> 00:05:29,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen, in this third step,</font>

85
00:05:29,260 --> 00:05:32,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you've got to use 100%
of what you have learned...</font>

86
00:05:32,180 --> 00:05:33,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And retain them.</font>

87
00:05:46,530 --> 00:05:47,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words,</font>

88
00:05:47,660 --> 00:05:50,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">imagine creating a single layer
within the balloon</font>

89
00:05:50,450 --> 00:05:53,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and compressing the Chakra inside it.</font>

90
00:05:55,250 --> 00:05:58,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know that in my head...</font>

91
00:05:59,170 --> 00:06:00,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But no matter what,</font>

92
00:06:01,170 --> 00:06:05,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't completely hold 100%
of my power in a neat ball...</font>

93
00:06:27,280 --> 00:06:31,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't give him false hope by teaching him
something he can't master.</font>

94
00:06:32,580 --> 00:06:38,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why the oblivious kid
starts joking about becoming a Hokage!</font>

95
00:06:53,010 --> 00:06:54,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tomorrow, huh.</font>

96
00:06:58,310 --> 00:06:59,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come again, okay?</font>

97
00:07:00,770 --> 00:07:02,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I certainly will!</font>

98
00:07:17,750 --> 00:07:19,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you going to meet
Orochimaru again?</font>

99
00:07:27,760 --> 00:07:30,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think she'd be that shaken up...</font>

100
00:07:31,180 --> 00:07:33,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Something extreme must have happened.</font>

101
00:07:35,220 --> 00:07:38,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That one week bugs me, somehow...</font>

102
00:07:44,770 --> 00:07:48,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And Naruto hasn't come back
to the inn for nearly a week.</font>

103
00:07:50,070 --> 00:07:53,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess I'll press Tsunade a little more.</font>

104
00:08:06,670 --> 00:08:07,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No good...</font>

105
00:08:11,340 --> 00:08:12,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No good... Why?</font>

106
00:08:14,640 --> 00:08:19,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here there's no time...
It'll be too late.</font>

107
00:08:27,690 --> 00:08:28,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this...?!</font>

108
00:08:32,070 --> 00:08:33,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened, Naruto-kun?!</font>

109
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:35,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you okay?</font>

110
00:08:51,590 --> 00:08:52,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you want?</font>

111
00:08:53,720 --> 00:08:55,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The moon's out.</font>

112
00:08:57,470 --> 00:08:58,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How about going out for a drink?</font>

113
00:09:08,980 --> 00:09:12,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tomorrow will be the one week
you promised to Naruto.</font>

114
00:09:19,580 --> 00:09:22,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder what became of Naruto?</font>

115
00:09:25,660 --> 00:09:26,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Beats me.</font>

116
00:09:33,050 --> 00:09:34,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess I'll have something.</font>

117
00:09:34,760 --> 00:09:35,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Radish, please.</font>

118
00:09:36,010 --> 00:09:36,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Coming up.</font>

119
00:09:49,150 --> 00:09:50,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh?</font>

120
00:09:55,440 --> 00:09:56,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here you go.</font>

121
00:09:57,570 --> 00:10:00,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ooh! This looks good.</font>

122
00:10:22,970 --> 00:10:24,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama!</font>

123
00:10:26,770 --> 00:10:27,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened to Naruto-kun?</font>

124
00:10:29,270 --> 00:10:30,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's quite exhausted and weakened.</font>

125
00:10:32,610 --> 00:10:34,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And his right hand is severely burned
with Chakra...</font>

126
00:10:36,780 --> 00:10:38,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As it stands now,</font>

127
00:10:38,950 --> 00:10:40,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">this kid probably won't wake up
until the day after tomorrow.</font>

128
00:10:44,370 --> 00:10:45,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's as Jiraiya says...</font>

129
00:10:47,450 --> 00:10:50,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why did I make such a stupid bet?</font>

130
00:10:52,040 --> 00:10:55,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What am I, of all people,
getting so worked up for?</font>

131
00:10:56,130 --> 00:10:57,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How stupid.</font>

132
00:11:03,100 --> 00:11:04,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tomorrow...</font>

133
00:11:06,810 --> 00:11:08,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please don't go tomorrow!</font>

134
00:11:12,650 --> 00:11:15,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't you say anything?!</font>

135
00:11:15,480 --> 00:11:18,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama! Please don't be silent.
Please answer!</font>

136
00:11:21,450 --> 00:11:23,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you say that you're going...</font>

137
00:11:24,990 --> 00:11:26,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What will you do?</font>

138
00:11:26,910 --> 00:11:29,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll stop you with my life!</font>

139
00:11:33,500 --> 00:11:37,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shizune... Have you forgotten
who you're talking to?</font>

140
00:12:00,570 --> 00:12:04,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sir! It's morning, now!
It's about time you went home!</font>

141
00:12:06,740 --> 00:12:07,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez.</font>

142
00:12:11,460 --> 00:12:14,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Get up, sir...</font>

143
00:12:19,840 --> 00:12:22,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! What's wrong, you?!</font>

144
00:12:31,020 --> 00:12:34,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'll be troublesome if we're disturbed
during the negotiations...</font>

145
00:12:35,400 --> 00:12:36,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you want me to do?</font>

146
00:12:37,440 --> 00:12:42,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It might be good to kill...
Tsunade's attendant.</font>

147
00:12:48,740 --> 00:12:50,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems that you...</font>

148
00:12:50,410 --> 00:12:53,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't trust me completely... yet.</font>

149
00:12:54,790 --> 00:12:57,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Precisely because I trust you...</font>

150
00:12:59,340 --> 00:13:02,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I would like to leave Sasuke-kun
in your hands.</font>

151
00:13:05,090 --> 00:13:06,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, then...</font>

152
00:13:06,680 --> 00:13:08,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kabuto...</font>

153
00:13:09,260 --> 00:13:11,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you wish to stop me...</font>

154
00:13:12,350 --> 00:13:16,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have no choice
but to kill young Sasuke-kun, now.</font>

155
00:13:17,810 --> 00:13:20,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't possibly kill me...</font>

156
00:13:27,570 --> 00:13:28,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

157
00:13:29,410 --> 00:13:30,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I said hey!</font>

158
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:36,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun...?</font>

159
00:13:37,920 --> 00:13:42,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh no! What time is it?
No, what day is it?</font>

160
00:13:43,710 --> 00:13:45,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's Monday...</font>

161
00:13:47,840 --> 00:13:49,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

162
00:13:50,140 --> 00:13:52,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is your body okay?</font>

163
00:13:53,470 --> 00:13:56,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As I recall, you were supposed
to sleep for two full days...</font>

164
00:13:57,850 --> 00:13:59,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter what the wound,</font>

165
00:13:59,150 --> 00:14:04,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm always able to recover
if I sleep one night!</font>

166
00:14:05,820 --> 00:14:08,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right.
This kid has Nine-Tailed Fox's power...</font>

167
00:14:09,070 --> 00:14:12,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More importantly,
where's that stupid old woman?!</font>

168
00:14:13,080 --> 00:14:15,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Today's the promised bet day.</font>

169
00:14:16,040 --> 00:14:17,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, what about the Jutsu...</font>

170
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:24,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's still not complete, but I can wing it...</font>

171
00:14:28,300 --> 00:14:30,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right. This isn't the time for this.</font>

172
00:14:30,930 --> 00:14:32,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Naruto-kun, please stay...
— Huh?</font>

173
00:14:35,470 --> 00:14:36,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are...!</font>

174
00:14:37,270 --> 00:14:38,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! Oh!</font>

175
00:14:44,230 --> 00:14:45,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait, Shizune!</font>

176
00:14:48,570 --> 00:14:53,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That damned Tsunade spiked my drink.</font>

177
00:14:54,330 --> 00:14:57,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't build up my Chakra well...</font>

178
00:14:57,080 --> 00:15:01,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And my body is so numb,
I can barely throw a Kunai Knife.</font>

179
00:15:02,710 --> 00:15:05,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What was he gonna do
if that had hit me?!</font>

180
00:15:05,920 --> 00:15:10,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's lame! Here you're always bragging
about how you're this awesome Ninja!</font>

181
00:15:10,340 --> 00:15:13,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And you're nailed by her perverted attack?
You, Pervy Pervy Sage?!</font>

182
00:15:13,220 --> 00:15:14,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

183
00:15:16,100 --> 00:15:19,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if she's rotten,
she's still a medical specialist.</font>

184
00:15:20,100 --> 00:15:25,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's the only one who could concoct
a tasteless and odorless drug for Ninja.</font>

185
00:15:27,110 --> 00:15:30,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But to think I'd be caught off-guard,</font>

186
00:15:30,950 --> 00:15:32,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">no matter how intoxicated I was...</font>

187
00:15:48,880 --> 00:15:50,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to kill you, bastard!</font>

188
00:16:02,730 --> 00:16:04,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How are you feeling,
Jiraiya-sama?</font>

189
00:16:05,900 --> 00:16:08,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Quite a bit better than this morning I
guess.</font>

190
00:16:09,490 --> 00:16:11,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But be that as it may,
maybe around thirty percent...</font>

191
00:16:15,740 --> 00:16:19,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I never thought I'd end up encountering
that Jiraiya-sama in a place like this...</font>

192
00:16:20,700 --> 00:16:24,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Things have gotten difficult.
I guess I'll pull back for now.</font>

193
00:16:26,590 --> 00:16:31,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At any rate, Naruto-kun...
To think you'd be here, too...</font>

194
00:16:40,390 --> 00:16:41,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Shizune.</font>

195
00:16:41,730 --> 00:16:43,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-Yes?!</font>

196
00:16:43,980 --> 00:16:45,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's about time you tell me</font>

197
00:16:45,440 --> 00:16:49,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">what the hell she was talking about
with Orochimaru.</font>

198
00:16:50,570 --> 00:16:51,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru?!</font>

199
00:16:56,870 --> 00:16:59,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wanted to believe Tsunade-sama...</font>

200
00:17:00,700 --> 00:17:03,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why I couldn't say until now.</font>

201
00:17:05,370 --> 00:17:06,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

202
00:17:08,750 --> 00:17:11,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no time.
Please come with me!</font>

203
00:17:12,340 --> 00:17:13,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll explain as we run!</font>

204
00:17:13,920 --> 00:17:14,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

205
00:17:14,800 --> 00:17:16,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going, too!</font>

206
00:17:37,860 --> 00:17:38,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's your answer?</font>

207
00:17:40,990 --> 00:17:42,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say what?!</font>

208
00:17:43,910 --> 00:17:46,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The answer to that is definitely no!</font>

209
00:17:47,170 --> 00:17:50,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This might be really bad...</font>

210
00:17:51,500 --> 00:17:56,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's probably still thinking
of those two.</font>

211
00:18:00,100 --> 00:18:04,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Perhaps I may have no choice,
but to kill Tsunade...</font>

212
00:18:06,640 --> 00:18:08,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

213
00:18:20,570 --> 00:18:21,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll heal your arms...</font>

214
00:18:23,330 --> 00:18:26,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In exchange for that,
keep your hands off the village.</font>

215
00:18:29,210 --> 00:18:30,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Very well.</font>

216
00:19:10,500 --> 00:19:11,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then...</font>

217
00:19:27,770 --> 00:19:29,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's planning to once again attack</font>

218
00:19:29,770 --> 00:19:31,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Leaf Village if
his arms are healed!</font>

219
00:19:32,440 --> 00:19:36,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The situation will get
even more dangerous than that</font>

220
00:19:36,270 --> 00:19:38,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if he's not stopped now.</font>

221
00:19:38,780 --> 00:19:40,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Him screwing around like that!</font>

222
00:19:44,870 --> 00:19:48,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have you.
There's no need to worry...</font>

223
00:20:50,100 --> 00:20:51,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the meaning of this?</font>

224
00:20:52,850 --> 00:20:55,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think you'd betray me at this point...</font>

225
00:21:03,320 --> 00:21:04,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade!</font>

226
00:21:05,230 --> 00:21:10,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I BELIEVE YOUR PROMISE ITS TRUE HEART TO GIVE ME COURAGE</b></font></font>

227
00:21:05,230 --> 00:21:10,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I believe your promise, it's a true heart gives me courage</b></font></font>

228
00:21:10,230 --> 00:21:15,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ALWAYS I FEEL IT THE PRECIOUS TIME WITH YOU</b></font></font>

229
00:21:10,230 --> 00:21:15,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>always I feel it the precious time with you</b></font></font>

230
00:21:15,200 --> 00:21:20,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>tachidomatta kado ni</b></font></font>

231
00:21:15,200 --> 00:21:20,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>on your still shoulder</b></font></font>

232
00:21:20,010 --> 00:21:24,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>asu e mukau kaze wo kanjiteta</b></font></font>

233
00:21:20,010 --> 00:21:24,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I feel the wind that blows towards tomorrow</b></font></font>

234
00:21:24,640 --> 00:21:30,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>machi no akari hoshikuzu mitai ni</b></font></font>

235
00:21:24,640 --> 00:21:30,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>the city lights are like pieces of stars</b></font></font>

236
00:21:30,580 --> 00:21:35,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>futari tsutsumu kedo</b></font></font>

237
00:21:30,580 --> 00:21:35,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>that hold us together</b></font></font>

238
00:21:35,250 --> 00:21:44,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>sorezore ni chigau kagayaki ga aru to</b></font></font>

239
00:21:35,250 --> 00:21:44,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>"each one of us glows differently"</b></font></font>

240
00:21:44,560 --> 00:21:47,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>warau kimi ga</b></font></font>

241
00:21:44,560 --> 00:21:47,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>you say laughingly</b></font></font>

242
00:21:47,440 --> 00:21:53,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ichiban mabushiku mieru yo</b></font></font>

243
00:21:47,440 --> 00:21:53,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>but you look most dazzling</b></font></font>

244
00:21:53,710 --> 00:21:58,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>yume wa ryuusei no you ni</b></font></font>

245
00:21:53,710 --> 00:21:58,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>like a comet</b></font></font>

246
00:21:58,140 --> 00:22:04,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ameagari no niji no you ni</b></font></font>

247
00:21:58,140 --> 00:22:04,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>like the rainbow after the storm</b></font></font>

248
00:22:04,290 --> 00:22:12,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>kono kokoro ni hikari wo tsuretekuru</b></font></font>

249
00:22:04,290 --> 00:22:12,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>you bring light into my heart</b></font></font>

250
00:22:12,490 --> 00:22:23,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>nayami tsuzukeru koto ga hitotsu no kotae ni naruyo</b></font></font>

251
00:22:12,490 --> 00:22:23,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>being lost can be the answer</b></font></font>

252
00:22:23,170 --> 00:22:30,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>gomakashitari shinai to chikau no</b></font></font>

253
00:22:23,170 --> 00:22:30,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>let's promise we won't cheat</b></font></font>

254
00:22:30,610 --> 00:22:35,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ALWAYS I FEEL IT THE PRECIOUS TIME WITH YOU</b></font></font>

255
00:22:30,610 --> 00:22:35,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>always I feel it the precious time with you</b></font></font>

256
00:22:37,620 --> 00:22:41,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What the hell is this?! This castle
has been destroyed even further!</font>

257
00:22:41,040 --> 00:22:44,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">It seems Tsunade has
declined the deal.</font>

258
00:22:44,750 --> 00:22:47,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">But... but the old lady is not here!</font>

259
00:22:47,220 --> 00:22:49,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Calm down a second.
She shouldn't have gone far from here.</font>

260
00:22:50,010 --> 00:22:52,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Oh, some incredible noise
from that direction, Pervy Sage!</font>

261
00:22:52,800 --> 00:22:55,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Well, well... she started a flashy battle.</font>

262
00:22:55,310 --> 00:22:56,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Naruto, we go after her!</font>

263
00:22:56,640 --> 00:22:59,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Right! I'm ready anytime!</font>

264
00:22:59,940 --> 00:23:01,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"Negotiations Broken Down!!"</font>

